@expand_councils
title: Support works councils.
subtitle: Give works councils a greater influence in managing enterprises.
view-if: works_councils == 0
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_pps += 7*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1; works_councils += 1; labor_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 8; psl_p_relation -= 8; coalition_dissent += 1 if psl_p_in_government
max-visits: 1

The works councils, elected by workers at each major business will now have worker representation on the boards of companies, giving them more influence in management decisions.


@expand_councils_2
title: Support national and sectorial works councils.
subtitle: This is a step towards workers' control over the entire economy.
view-if: works_councils == 1
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_pps += 7*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1; works_councils += 1; labor_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 8; psl_p_relation -= 8; coalition_dissent += 1 if psl_p_in_government; economic_growth += 0.1 if economic_growth < 3
max-visits: 1

We strengthen the legitimacy of national and sectorial works council.

@expand_councils_3
title: Empower sectorial works councils.
subtitle: Give works councils a role in setting wage and price policy for entire industrial sectors.
view-if: works_councils == 2
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_pps += 7*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1; works_councils += 1; labor_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 8; psl_p_relation -= 8; coalition_dissent += 1 if psl_p_in_government; unemployed -= 2 if unemployed > 5; workers += 2; economic_growth += 0.1 if economic_growth < 3
max-visits: 1

Sectorial works councils can now negotiate wage and price policies for entire economic sectors, helping to both give workers more of a voice, and to rationalize the economy, smoothing over the anarchy of the market.

@suspend_germans_1
title: Expropriate or suspend <span style="color: #000000;">Ge</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">rm</span><span style="color: #FFCE00;">an</span-owned factories
subtitle: -1 budget, This is a step to removing the control of foreign interest in the economy.
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_pps += 7*(1-dissent); minorities_pps -= 4*(1+dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1; nationalist_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; labor_strength += 8; bmn_relation -= 10; coalition_dissent += 2 if bmn_in_government; economic_growth -= 0.5
max-visits: 2

The Polish people

@nationalize_1
title: Begin to socialize key industries.
subtitle: -1 budget, we should buy out industries and govern them together with workers and consumers.
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; capital_strike_progress += 1; budget -= 1; socializations += 1; workers_spd += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if in_grand_coalition; capital_strike_progress += 1 if black_thursday_seen; unemployed -= 1 if unemployed > 9; economic_growth += 0.2 if economic_growth < 5
choose-if: budget >= 1
max-visits: 3

We have begun to socialize key industries by buying out the capitalist owners, and creating coordinated governing boards consisting of worker, consumer, and state representatives. The capitalists are not pleased at our intrusion into the economy.

@cooperatives_1
title: Support worker and consumer cooperatives.
subtitle: -1 budget
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; cooperatives += 1; workers_pps += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_pps += 4*(1-dissent); budget -= 1; unemployed -= 1 if unemployed > 9; economic_growth += 0.2
choose-if: budget >= 1
max-visits: 3

We have enacted legislation that makes it easier to create cooperative enterprises of all sorts, and provide financial support to struggling cooperatives.
